{"version":1,"content":"<p>當地時間11月13日下午，美國聯邦航空管理局（FAA）宣佈對全美所有機場實施全國範圍的「地面停飛令」（Ground Stop），原因是一項影響所有航空航路交通管制中心（Air Route Traffic Control Centers）的通信故障。該措施導致全美範圍內所有計劃起飛的航班暫停離港，美國航空運輸網絡受到大規模衝擊。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586324.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T23:09:26.325716+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":169,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T22:48:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T23:02:33.144475+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T23:02:33.144475+00:00","content_hash":"6f685d4fef4f5863f96adba29de1de3aaec2654607b71b11dca91a5fd7bcd387","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}